# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] dynamic-flag.js is dynamically imported by a.js but also statically imported by a.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

